Subject: [PATCH] DRV_DPM_SW-339: DPM cleanup ptp macro

---
 drivers/net/datapath/dpm/Kconfig                 | 14 --------------
 drivers/net/datapath/dpm/datapath_instance.c     |  4 ++--
 drivers/net/datapath/dpm/datapath_ioctl.c        | 12 ++++--------
